WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.417 --> 00:00:02.544
♪♪

00:00:02.544 --> 00:00:04.213
Wolfboy:
They think I'm weird mum.

00:00:04.922 --> 00:00:06.423
Do you think I'm weird?

00:00:06.423 --> 00:00:10.886
It's the dreamers like you who
change this world for the
better.

00:00:10.886 --> 00:00:14.264
♪♪

00:00:14.264 --> 00:00:15.182
(Laughter)

00:00:15.182 --> 00:00:16.099
Kid:
Lame mask.

00:00:16.099 --> 00:00:17.351
(Kids Laughing)

00:00:17.351 --> 00:00:21.772
♪♪

00:00:21.772 --> 00:00:22.773
Wow!

00:00:22.773 --> 00:00:23.273
Oof!

00:00:23.273 --> 00:00:25.234
♪♪

00:00:25.234 --> 00:00:26.068
Hey!

00:00:26.068 --> 00:00:31.865
♪♪

00:00:31.865 --> 00:00:33.909
Ahh!

00:00:33.909 --> 00:00:35.494
♪♪

00:00:35.494 --> 00:00:36.495
(Gasp)

00:00:37.663 --> 00:00:39.122
Wolfboy:
What is this place?

00:00:39.122 --> 00:00:40.415
(Thump)

00:00:40.415 --> 00:00:41.792
You followin' us, pal?

00:00:41.792 --> 00:00:43.669
Yeah, pal.
(Beeping noise)

00:00:43.669 --> 00:00:45.254
He's a human.

00:00:45.254 --> 00:00:46.129
(Gasp)

00:00:46.129 --> 00:00:47.631
A human?

00:00:47.631 --> 00:00:50.509
♪♪

00:00:50.509 --> 00:00:51.802
(Growl)
Zandar:
-Listen up, human,

00:00:51.802 --> 00:00:53.553
Zandar:
'cause we're only gonna go over
this once.

00:00:53.553 --> 00:00:56.306
Zandar:
We're Sprites, and this is
the Everything Factory.

00:00:56.306 --> 00:00:57.307
-Growl
-Oh!

00:00:57.307 --> 00:00:59.851
Zandar:
This is where we create things
for the world.

00:00:59.851 --> 00:01:01.353
Zandar:
Trees.
-Hello.

00:01:01.353 --> 00:01:02.229
Zandar:
The weather.

00:01:02.229 --> 00:01:03.522
(Thunder and lightning)
Zandar:
Even life.

00:01:03.522 --> 00:01:05.524
♪♪

00:01:05.524 --> 00:01:07.568
I love creating things.

00:01:07.568 --> 00:01:09.152
Wolfboy:
I make things all the time.

00:01:09.152 --> 00:01:10.821
Zandar:
Rabbits don't have wings.

00:01:10.821 --> 00:01:11.697
Wolfboy:
Mine does.

00:01:11.697 --> 00:01:15.033
You've got a lot to learn
about how the world really
works, human.

00:01:15.033 --> 00:01:15.492
♪♪

00:01:15.492 --> 00:01:19.288
There's something about him, I
can feel it tickling my beard.

00:01:19.288 --> 00:01:21.999
Sprout:
Humans can't see sprites, but he
can see me.

00:01:21.999 --> 00:01:23.000
Fascinating.

00:01:23.000 --> 00:01:26.044
The three of you must stay in
your dorm until further notice.

00:01:26.044 --> 00:01:28.171
No its, no buts, no coconuts.

00:01:28.171 --> 00:01:29.172
(Door shuts)

00:01:29.881 --> 00:01:32.676
Especially no coconuts.

00:01:32.676 --> 00:01:33.844
Athena:
Attack!

00:01:33.844 --> 00:01:35.929
Disarrays are pure chaos.

00:01:35.929 --> 00:01:36.596
(Thunderous growl)

00:01:36.596 --> 00:01:40.142
Zandra:
Every single thing we sprites
create, Disarrays destroys.

00:01:40.142 --> 00:01:42.936
Nobody panic...Ah!
Everybody play dead.

00:01:42.936 --> 00:01:45.063
♪♪

00:01:45.063 --> 00:01:47.774
This is so adventure-y!
-Hoo-ray!

00:01:47.774 --> 00:01:49.443
-Hoo-ray!

00:01:49.443 --> 00:01:50.235
Hoo-ray...

00:01:50.235 --> 00:01:52.070
Woo-hoo!
(Excitement)

00:01:52.070 --> 00:01:59.453
♪♪

00:01:59.453 --> 00:02:00.704
What do we do now?

00:02:00.704 --> 00:02:01.705
We fight!

00:02:01.705 --> 00:02:02.372
♪♪

00:02:02.372 --> 00:02:05.083
You're not like the others, are
you?

00:02:05.083 --> 00:02:06.084
♪♪

00:02:06.084 --> 00:02:08.170
Lux:
There's more to you than meets
the eye.

00:02:08.170 --> 00:02:09.588
I know who you are...

00:02:09.588 --> 00:02:10.172
Zandra:
Wolfboy!

00:02:10.172 --> 00:02:11.590
Run!

00:02:11.590 --> 00:02:12.883
Lux:
And who you will become.

00:02:12.883 --> 00:02:17.471
♪♪

